          "line": 22,
          "text": "The Polymarket CTF Exchange is an exchange protocol that facilitates atomic swaps between [Conditional Tokens Framework(CTF)](https://docs.gnosis.io/conditionaltokens/) ERC1155 assets and an ERC20 collateral asset."
